#: ../../technical/articles/112-settings-storage-routing-corpus-citations-and-credentials.md:24
msgid "Evidence, review, and corpus handling"
msgstr "Evidències, revisió i tractament del corpus"

#: ../../technical/articles/112-settings-storage-routing-corpus-citations-and-credentials.md:26
msgid ""
"The confirmation vocabulary separates deterministic blockers from non-"
"blocking advisories and maps every blocker to an operator action. Actions"
" record whether a person chose among captured candidates, supplied a "
"value absent from the page, or attested that a finding was acceptable "
"after review. The taxonomy intentionally has no “waive” or bulk bypass "
"member. `DraftDiscrepancyKind` names checks over parsed values, not a "
"model’s self-assessed confidence, and `ConfirmationBlockReason` "
"distinguishes arithmetic closure, identity, direction, regime, territory,"
" party attribution, and invoice-class failures. confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) draft_discrepancy.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/draft_discrepancy.py`)"
msgstr ""
"El vocabulari de confirmació separa bloquejos deterministes d'avisos no "
"bloquejants i associa cada bloqueig amb una acció de l'operador. Les "
"accions registren si una persona ha triat entre candidats capturats, ha "
"aportat un valor absent de la pàgina o ha acreditat que una incidència "
"era acceptable després de revisar. La taxonomia intencionadament no té "
"cap membre de «dispensa» o evasió massiva. `DraftDiscrepancyKind` anomena"
" comprovacions sobre valors analitzats, no la confiança autoavaluada d'un"
" model, i `ConfirmationBlockReason` distingeix fallades de tancament "
"aritmètic, identitat, direcció, règim, territori, atribució de parts i "
"classe de factura. confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) confirmation_gate.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/confirmation_gate.py`) draft_discrepancy.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/draft_discrepancy.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/112-settings-storage-routing-corpus-citations-and-credentials.md:28
msgid ""
"`corpus_text.py` normalizes bundled legal text and resolves citations to "
"exactly one extracted sidecar unit. It prefers literal/exact anchors, "
"then carefully constrained single-unit, article-point, and structural-"
"heading resolution; missing or duplicate candidates raise typed errors "
"instead of returning an entire unrelated document. It also enumerates "
"dated redaction marks without treating source order as recency, since the"
" two BOE payload shapes use opposite orderings. The normalizer and cache "
"operate over bundled legal material, while `required_text` is a later "
"verification condition, not a selection shortcut. corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`corpus_text.py` normalitza text legal incorporat i resol citacions a "
"exactament una unitat extreta d'un fitxer complementari. Prefereix "
"àncores literals o exactes i després resolució restringida amb cura a una"
" unitat única, punt d'article i capçalera estructural; els candidats "
"absents o duplicats generen errors tipats en lloc de retornar un document"
" sencer no relacionat. També enumera marques datades de redacció sense "
"tractar l'ordre de font com a actualitat, perquè les dues formes de "
"càrrega útil del BOE utilitzen ordres oposats. El normalitzador i la "
"memòria cau operen sobre material legal incorporat, mentre que "
"`required_text` és una condició posterior de verificació, no una drecera "
"de selecció. corpus_text.py (`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) "
"corpus_text.py (`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`) corpus_text.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/corpus_text.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/112-settings-storage-routing-corpus-citations-and-credentials.md:30
msgid ""
"`DocumentShape` classifies bytes by their actual contents. It "
"distinguishes standalone structured invoices and PDFs with embedded XML "
"from scans and text-layer PDFs. Structured SII and VERI*FACTU submissions"
" remain outside the single-invoice set because each is a collection and "
"could otherwise be silently collapsed to one record. "
"`ExportExemptionReason` similarly makes the reason a casilla is not "
"addressed explicit; it distinguishes true record-design absence, internal"
" intermediates, AEAT prefill, indirect binding output, formula-verified "
"downstream output, and a known unmodelled record block. document_shape.py"
" (`src/cadrumo/core/document_shape.py`) document_shape.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/document_shape.py`) export_exemption_reason.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/export_exemption_reason.py`) estado_casilla_oficial.py"
" (`src/cadrumo/core/estado_casilla_oficial.py`) export_layout_format.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/export_layout_format.py`)"
msgstr ""
"`DocumentShape` classifica bytes pel contingut real. Distingeix factures "
"estructurades independents i PDF amb XML incorporat d'escaneigs i PDF amb"
" capa de text. Les trameses estructurades SII i VERI*FACTU queden fora "
"del conjunt de factura única perquè cadascuna és una col·lecció i "
"altrament es podria reduir silenciosament a un sol registre. Igualment, "
"`ExportExemptionReason` fa explícit el motiu pel qual una casella no "
"s'adreça; distingeix absència real del disseny de registre, intermedis "
"interns, preemplenament AEAT, sortida indirecta de vinculació, sortida "
"posterior verificada per fórmula i un bloc conegut de registres no "
"modelat. document_shape.py (`src/cadrumo/core/document_shape.py`) "
"document_shape.py (`src/cadrumo/core/document_shape.py`) "
"export_exemption_reason.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/export_exemption_reason.py`) estado_casilla_oficial.py"
" (`src/cadrumo/core/estado_casilla_oficial.py`) export_layout_format.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/export_layout_format.py`)"

#: ../../technical/articles/112-settings-storage-routing-corpus-citations-and-credentials.md:32
msgid ""
"The shared directory scanner provides sorted and lazy traversal, explicit"
" file/directory selection, pruning, and predictable missing-root "
"behavior. It closes each directory handle before yielding, refuses "
"ambiguous multi-segment patterns, does not follow directory symlinks, and"
" uses an explicit stack so deep trees do not consume Python recursion "
"depth. `credentials.py` enforces profile-password bounds by Unicode "
"scalar count and strict UTF-8 size, rejects surrogate code points, and "
"returns only finite reasons and numeric metadata; strength is guidance "
"rather than an acceptance rule and the candidate is not retained. "
"`ed25519_signing.py` signs the raw decoded digest bytes, while key "
"custody remains a caller responsibility. directory_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) directory_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) directory_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) directory_scan.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) ed25519_signing.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/ed25519_signing.py`) ed25519_signing.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/ed25519_signing.py`) descriptor_write.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/descriptor_write.py`)"
msgstr ""
"L'explorador compartit de directoris proporciona recorregut ordenat i "
"diferit, selecció explícita de fitxers o directoris, poda i comportament "
"predictible d'arrel absent. Tanca cada identificador de directori abans "
"de retornar elements, refusa patrons ambigus de múltiples segments, no "
"segueix enllaços simbòlics de directoris i utilitza una pila explícita "
"perquè els arbres profunds no consumeixin la profunditat de recursió de "
"Python. `credentials.py` imposa límits de contrasenyes de perfil per "
"recompte d'escalars Unicode i mida UTF-8 estricta, rebutja punts de codi "
"substituts i només retorna motius finits i metadades numèriques; la "
"fortalesa és orientació en lloc d'una regla d'acceptació i el candidat no"
" es conserva. `ed25519_signing.py` signa els bytes crus descodificats de "
"l'empremta, mentre que la custòdia de claus continua sent responsabilitat"
" del cridador. directory_scan.py (`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) "
"directory_scan.py (`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) "
"directory_scan.py (`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) "
"directory_scan.py (`src/cadrumo/core/directory_scan.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) credentials.py "
"(`src/cadrumo/core/credentials.py`) ed25519_signing.py "
